### 创建部门
POST http://localhost:8080/adm/department/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "DEMO",
  "name": "Demo Department",
  "description": "manual verification",
  "status": 1
}

### 用户创建员工，userId 将被 X-User-ID 强制覆盖
POST http://localhost:8080/usr/employee/save
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: 10001

{
  "departmentId": 1,
  "userId": 99999,
  "employeeNo": "EMP-001",
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "status": 1
}

### 用户查询自己的员工
GET http://localhost:8080/usr/employee/by-id/1
X-User-ID: 10001

### 用户分页查询自己的员工
POST http://localhost:8080/usr/employee/query-by-page
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: 10001

{
  "number": 1,
  "size": 10,
  "condition": {
    "name": "Alice"
  }
}

### 管理端统计部门员工数量
GET http://localhost:8080/adm/employee/count-by-department/1
